# UASF 360 CLI

- Bash-first; canonical HTTP only in `lib/http.sh`.
- Every outbound request MUST pass `lib/safety.sh` / `lib/scope.sh` gates.
- Modules MUST NOT invoke `curl` directly or write evidence except via `lib/evidence.sh`.
